@startuml SSD_UC005_Forward_Obstacle_To_Backward
hide footbox
title SSD - UC-005 전진 중 장애물 감지 후 후진 전환

actor "센서 입력" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as System
actor "청소 장치" as Cleaner
actor "주행 장치" as Drive

Sensor -> System: reportSensorSnapshot(dustDetected=false, currentDirection=FORWARD, frontObstacleDetected=true)
activate System
System -> Cleaner: setCleaningPower(NORMAL)
System -> Drive: turnClockwise90()

Sensor -> System: reportBackObstacleState(backObstacleDetected)

loop 후방 장애물 감지
    System -> Drive: turnClockwise90()
    Sensor -> System: reportBackObstacleState(backObstacleDetected)
end

System -> Drive: moveBackward()
note right of System: 진행 방향 = 후진

deactivate System
@enduml
